sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Client
    participant GW as API Gateway (Kong)
    participant CO as Coordinator Agent
    participant CA as Customer Agent
    participant OA as Order Agent
    participant CS as Customer Service
    participant OS as Order Service

    U->>GW: POST /api/agent/query<br/>"Find customer C001 and tell me their latest order status"
    Note over GW: key-auth (chat-frontend) · ACL · rate limit<br/>X-Correlation-ID + trace started
    GW->>CO: forward
    Note over CO: PLAN: s1 get_customer(C001)<br/>s2 get_latest_order(C001), only if s1 found
    Note over CO: DISCOVER via Agent Cards:<br/>get_customer → Customer Agent<br/>get_latest_order → Order Agent
    CO->>CA: A2A message/send · get_customer(C001)
    CA->>GW: GET /api/customers/C001 (customer-agent key)
    GW->>CS: GET /customers/C001
    CS-->>CA: 200 Somchai Jaidee
    CA-->>CO: Task completed · outcome found
    CO->>OA: A2A message/send · get_latest_order(C001)
    OA->>GW: GET /api/orders?customer_id=C001&limit=1 (order-agent key)
    GW->>OS: GET /orders?customer_id=C001&limit=1
    OS-->>OA: 200 [O1006 SHIPPED]
    OA-->>CO: Task completed · outcome found
    Note over CO: ANSWER only from task results
    CO-->>GW: 200 status=completed · answer · reasoning · steps · trace_id
    GW-->>U: "Customer C001 is Somchai Jaidee … latest order O1006 … SHIPPED"
